DESCRIPTION:Refreshments (including local ice cream\, popcorn\, and popsi
 cles) will be served as you network with fellow IU Bloomington graduate s
 tudents from all academic areas. Get to know your librarians\, Graduate &
 amp\; Professional Student Government members\, and graduate school staff
 .Enter our raffle to win premium Sony-brand Bluetooth over-the-ear noise-
 cancelling headphones.At 3:45 p.m. join our Ruth Lilly Dean of University
  Libraries\, Diane Dallis-Comentale for a lively game of B-I-N-G-O where 
 students win prizes such as apartment toolkits\, snack boxes\, and game n
 ight baskets!Your RSVP is very appreciated for our planning purposes\, bu
 t not required to attend.&#160\;&#160\;The Wells Library is on city bus r
 oute 9 (https://bloomingtontransit.com/maps-and-schedules/) and IU campus
  bus routes B\, E\, and F (https://iubus.indiana.edu/schedules/index.html
 ). Paid parking is available at the East Garage.
